WEBVTT

00:09:27.225 --> 00:09:30.444
Beš ydiru had el-ši.

00:09:30.444 --> 00:09:34.258
W elli tkakaw lih

00:09:34.258 --> 00:09:39.191
huwa belli el-teɛnaf b el-blayeṣ, elli yexxedmu fiha,

00:09:39.191 --> 00:09:43.710
mši ġir naqeṣ ‘insaniya,

00:09:43.710 --> 00:09:45.845
beṣṣaḥ tanik naqeṣ fayda

00:09:45.845 --> 00:09:52.376
ɛla ki yexxedmu b el-sira elli tejmeɛ nas b nas waḥduxrin beš yɛawdu el-benyan.

00:09:52.376 --> 00:09:56.308
W ybanli belli el-ɛesker ntaɛ el-Marikan

00:09:56.308 --> 00:10:03.188
Bdaw yeffaḥmu had el-ši.